WEBVTT

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:06.406
Noise clear. Reacquiring image.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:07.173
Noise clear. Reacquiring image.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.576
Real-time image correction starting.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:12.879
- Distortion compensation rate
is deviating 3.74 from expected,
- Beginning recording of all radiation values.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.781
- And still increasing. Recompensating.
- Beginning recording of all radiation values.

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.183
- Receiving reports of increasing
neutrinos from the Super-Kamiokande.
- Gamma rays are decreasing.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.219
- Receiving reports of increasing
neutrinos from the Super-Kamiokande.
- Gravitational lens effect confirmed.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:22.055
Recovering image.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.189
What is that?

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.214
Maximum image magnification.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:53.887
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:59.759
sono itami no imi sae

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:05.465
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:08.662
Boku wa kitto...

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:16.409
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:23.950
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:26.820
I'll always be with you

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.456
see the sky in front of you

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:33.825
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:41.001
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:01:41.001 --> 00:01:43.670
utau yo

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:52.339
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.224
I'll be waiting for you...

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.851
...at that lighthouse.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.554
Waiting for me?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.657
Toa?!

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.596
Toa?

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.176
Would you come here a minute?

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.768
A child?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.511
Please excuse me.

00:03:23.103 --> 00:03:26.038
Who were those guys?

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.929
Hey, let me out of here!

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:02.609
You're watching me in
there, right?! Where am I?!

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:04.644
ISDA.

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:08.181
ISDA? What on earth for?

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:10.083
We have business with you.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:14.654
Business? What business?!
Let me out of here, first!

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:17.646
What if I said we
needed a word with you...

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:23.623
...about the shuttle
accident two years ago?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.043
Little man.

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:39.546
Ka-zu-ki...

00:04:39.546 --> 00:04:41.639
Tachibana Kazuki.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:51.558
- Gio...
- Gio?

00:04:51.558 --> 00:04:54.627
Kitajima-senpai, this guy is funny.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:58.565
He's mistakenly read the
code number G-10 as "Gio."

00:04:58.565 --> 00:05:00.633
Now, he's using it as a name.

00:05:00.633 --> 00:05:02.863
"Gio," huh?

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.234
That's not bad, is it?

00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:12.579
Just what is the meaning
of bringing me here?

00:05:12.579 --> 00:05:16.716
You say you need a word with
me about the shuttle accident?

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:21.210
That shuttle accident was not
caused by your father's pilot error.

00:05:24.357 --> 00:05:29.596
You know that 20 years ago, Pluto
was destroyed by Thanatos, right?

00:05:29.596 --> 00:05:33.866
But everyone was told that
it wouldn't collide with Earth.

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:38.538
It is currently holding position
in Pluto's old orbit. However,

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:42.542
Thanatos will definitely
be coming to Earth.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:45.845
The signs have already started.

00:05:45.845 --> 00:05:50.544
The shuttle accident two
years ago... was caused...

00:05:52.252 --> 00:05:54.420
...by this.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.723
W-What is it?

00:05:56.723 --> 00:06:00.360
An extraterrestrial life form,
sent here from Thanatos.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.862
We call it a "Dragon."

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:05.298
Dragon? So what exactly...

00:06:05.298 --> 00:06:10.637
Unfortunately, it collided with
the shuttle that you were aboard.

00:06:10.637 --> 00:06:15.975
Extraterrestrial life form?
Thanatos? What is this?

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:19.979
More importantly, what about the
truth concerning the accident?

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:23.616
Why didn't you announce that
the shuttle was destroyed

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:25.918
by an extraterrestrial life form?!

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:31.391
Ever since the accident, my dad
has been treated like a criminal.

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.427
Please, prove that my father
was innocent, right now!

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:37.330
I'm sorry, but we can't do that.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.631
Who are you?

00:06:38.631 --> 00:06:44.237
Lindworm Unit Captain Raina
Cromwell. Kamishina-kun,

00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:47.173
I know how you must feel,
but I want you to think about

00:06:47.173 --> 00:06:51.010
what would happen if we
announced that the shuttle accident

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:55.748
was the work of an
extraterrestrial life form.

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:57.306
But!

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:03.990
The Dragonauts are the only
force that can oppose Thanatos.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.826
If you hold Thanatos responsible
for taking your family from you,

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.657
then become a Dragonaut!

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:17.361
What's a "Dragonaut"?

00:07:19.806 --> 00:07:22.508
Please prove that my dad was innocent.

00:07:22.508 --> 00:07:24.476
Then we can talk!

00:07:27.213 --> 00:07:28.781
Where do you think you're going?

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:30.350
I'm going home.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.682
You don't have anywhere to go home to.

00:07:36.556 --> 00:07:39.184
I'm sorry I'm late!

00:07:43.062 --> 00:07:44.689
Kazuki?

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:48.626
Jin...

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:54.374
You'll be staying at the ISDA
facility for a little while.

00:07:54.374 --> 00:07:57.210
We've contacted your family,
so don't be concerned about that.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.912
I'm not all that concerned anyhow.

00:07:59.912 --> 00:08:02.215
Oh, no? Then, okay.

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:06.753
I'm awfully happy to be able
to see you again like this, Jin!

00:08:06.753 --> 00:08:11.157
After the accident, you dropped
out of astronaut training school,

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:14.422
so I thought we'd never
see each other again.

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:18.865
Hey, you remember?

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:21.663
We made that promise to each other.

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:26.027
Up on that hill.

00:08:28.608 --> 00:08:30.109
Someday...

00:08:30.109 --> 00:08:33.012
...let's both go into outer
space together, okay, Jin?

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:36.349
Yeah. Someday, together...

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:38.943
- Promise?
- Yeah.

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:43.245
Someday, for sure.

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:53.099
It was our dream to go out
into space. So then, why?

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:55.802
Why are you declining?

00:08:55.802 --> 00:08:58.204
Come on, be a Dragonaut with me.

00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:01.073
Did you know?

00:09:01.073 --> 00:09:05.378
About my dad not being
the cause of the accident?

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:10.149
Y-Yeah, I knew. But not until
after I became a Dragonaut.

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:13.753
I didn't know at the time of the accident.

00:09:13.753 --> 00:09:16.222
No, I suppose not.

00:09:16.222 --> 00:09:18.053
Jin...

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:27.099
Are you serious about making
Kamishina Jin a Dragonaut?

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:29.235
Is there some problem with that?

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.503
No, but...

00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:33.172
You'd welcome him with open arms
if he had the Album with him.

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:35.408
Is that what Dr. Kitajima said?

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:37.643
She didn't have to say it.

00:09:37.643 --> 00:09:41.647
Kamishina Jin is sure to have
contact with the Album again.

00:09:41.647 --> 00:09:46.118
When that happens, use all our
resources to capture her. Got it?

00:09:46.118 --> 00:09:47.949
Acknowledged.

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:13.513
The shuttle accident two
years ago... was caused...

00:10:13.513 --> 00:10:15.114
...by this.

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:17.950
If you hold Thanatos responsible
for taking your family from you,

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.886
then become a Dragonaut!

00:10:19.886 --> 00:10:23.322
What a bunch of self-serving talk.

00:10:23.322 --> 00:10:25.725
Screw 'em.

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:27.556
Screw 'em!

00:10:29.896 --> 00:10:31.727
Screw them!

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:45.878
I have to go...

00:10:45.878 --> 00:10:47.709
To Toa...

00:11:17.076 --> 00:11:19.067
- Toa...
- Jin!

00:11:23.616 --> 00:11:25.243
Toa...

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:41.601
Um... about yesterday...

00:11:41.601 --> 00:11:44.070
I don't really remember what happened.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47.807
I do sort of remember falling
from that building, but...

00:11:47.807 --> 00:11:50.109
You don't need to force
yourself to remember.

00:11:50.109 --> 00:11:53.476
Just remember that you ran into me.

00:12:04.757 --> 00:12:07.059
Contact with the Album confirmed.

00:12:07.059 --> 00:12:10.620
Roger. Please continue to monitor them.

00:12:13.599 --> 00:12:15.430
You're not getting away this time.

00:12:17.403 --> 00:12:18.838
What's the matter?

00:12:18.838 --> 00:12:22.108
Toa, have you ever been in outer space?

00:12:22.108 --> 00:12:25.745
Have you ever seen the Earth from space?

00:12:25.745 --> 00:12:27.647
Yes.

00:12:27.647 --> 00:12:29.638
What was it like?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.616
I thought it was a pretty planet.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:53.339
Enough to change your life?

00:12:53.339 --> 00:12:55.273
Maybe it did change.

00:13:13.392 --> 00:13:15.292
That was nasty!

00:13:18.898 --> 00:13:22.635
Currently, the Album is out
of ISDA's observation network,

00:13:22.635 --> 00:13:24.837
and is fleeing through
the mountains northwest

00:13:24.837 --> 00:13:27.506
of the lighthouse with Kamishina Jin.

00:13:27.506 --> 00:13:31.177
All Lindworm Unit members,
link with your Communicators,

00:13:31.177 --> 00:13:34.246
locate the two of them
quickly, and secure them.

00:13:34.246 --> 00:13:37.650
Also, if they do not follow our instructions,

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.552
you are authorized to use weapons.

00:13:39.552 --> 00:13:41.179
That is all.

00:13:42.488 --> 00:13:45.391
I will now brief you on your stations.

00:13:45.391 --> 00:13:48.761
- Jin... why?
- Akira, go with the special forces,
and cut off the target's path of retreat.

00:13:48.761 --> 00:13:51.897
Amagi, you and Kazuki
take the island's west exit.

00:13:51.897 --> 00:13:53.999
I'll close the net at the north exit.

00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:56.490
As far as Actualizing...

00:14:00.606 --> 00:14:02.039
Scatter!

00:14:17.089 --> 00:14:18.784
What is this?

00:14:25.564 --> 00:14:27.199
Here.

00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:29.735
Thanks.

00:14:29.735 --> 00:14:32.932
We took off running so fast,
my throat is all parched.

00:14:35.808 --> 00:14:38.577
But what on earth came over you?

00:14:38.577 --> 00:14:42.648
You'd better not go near ISDA anymore.

00:14:42.648 --> 00:14:44.275
Wha...?!

00:14:53.993 --> 00:14:57.263
W-What's going on here?!

00:14:57.263 --> 00:14:59.732
Hey, look over here!

00:14:59.732 --> 00:15:03.669
Do as I say, nice and easy,
and we won't do anything rough.

00:15:03.669 --> 00:15:08.407
I wonder if the two of you
would accompany me for a bit.

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:10.442
What are you talking about?

00:15:10.442 --> 00:15:12.967
You guys aren't making any sense!

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:20.408
Machina!

00:15:32.965 --> 00:15:34.694
I've got you.

00:15:37.436 --> 00:15:39.138
Toa!

00:15:39.138 --> 00:15:41.606
I'll come get you, I promise!

00:15:52.051 --> 00:15:53.712
After her, Machina!

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:57.547
Toa...

00:16:15.674 --> 00:16:17.176
Whoa...

00:16:17.176 --> 00:16:19.044
That's far enough,

00:16:19.044 --> 00:16:20.705
Album.

00:16:27.853 --> 00:16:29.480
Toa!

00:16:31.991 --> 00:16:33.481
Jin!

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:38.819
Kazuki...

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.169
W-Why are you running away?

00:16:44.169 --> 00:16:48.274
You promised me we'd go
into space together. So why...

00:16:48.274 --> 00:16:51.510
- Kazuki, you...
- Don't move!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.779
Don't move.

00:16:53.779 --> 00:16:55.714
Are you going to shoot me?

00:16:55.714 --> 00:16:59.018
I don't want to shoot! We're...

00:16:59.018 --> 00:17:00.686
...best friends, aren't we?!

00:17:00.686 --> 00:17:06.425
So come back to ISDA with me.

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:10.963
What is this? What the hell is this?

00:17:10.963 --> 00:17:15.401
You chase me all over the place,
and threaten me with a gun...

00:17:15.401 --> 00:17:18.237
What kind of best friend is that?!

00:17:18.237 --> 00:17:20.306
Jin...

00:17:20.306 --> 00:17:24.709
I really... am all alone.

00:17:40.159 --> 00:17:42.594
Toa, are you all right?!

00:17:42.594 --> 00:17:45.222
- I'm fine.
- But...

00:17:55.607 --> 00:17:58.974
You're not alone. I'm here, after all.

00:18:04.483 --> 00:18:06.352
You won't get away!

00:18:06.352 --> 00:18:09.788
Jin! Amagi-san! What are you...

00:18:09.788 --> 00:18:11.623
How could you?!

00:18:11.623 --> 00:18:14.760
I-I shot...

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.092
I shot a person.

00:18:33.979 --> 00:18:36.281
Abnormality detected in Spirytus!

00:18:36.281 --> 00:18:39.351
Communication value
with his Master is dropping!

00:18:39.351 --> 00:18:42.021
If it keeps up, he can't
maintain his Communicator form!

00:18:42.021 --> 00:18:44.649
This is impossible!

00:18:46.291 --> 00:18:47.952
Where's Amagi?

00:18:49.061 --> 00:18:55.034
More! More! I want...
I want to kill more people!

00:18:55.034 --> 00:18:57.059
His Resonance Connect...

00:19:14.019 --> 00:19:16.855
W-Why are you doing this here?!

00:19:16.855 --> 00:19:18.991
Amagi-san!

00:19:18.991 --> 00:19:20.392
Terrific!

00:19:20.392 --> 00:19:23.520
Wreck some more stuff, Spirytus!

00:19:25.697 --> 00:19:28.567
A-Amagi-san!

00:19:28.567 --> 00:19:30.502
What are you doing, Amagi?!

00:19:30.502 --> 00:19:32.438
Get him back to being
a Communicator, now!

00:19:32.438 --> 00:19:36.542
Amagi-san... Amagi-san
has been eaten by Spirytus!

00:19:36.542 --> 00:19:38.177
What?!

00:19:38.177 --> 00:19:39.906
That's nasty.

00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:51.011
What?!

00:19:52.758 --> 00:19:55.591
What are you Actualizing here for?!

00:19:57.396 --> 00:19:58.797
This is bad.

00:19:58.797 --> 00:20:02.868
Without his Master, his
Resonance Connect won't function.

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:05.237
If that happens...

00:20:05.237 --> 00:20:07.637
The Dragon will start
running out of control.

00:20:12.911 --> 00:20:14.746
Impossible!

00:20:14.746 --> 00:20:17.049
What is going on?!

00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:20.552
Spirytus will be approaching
the observation park any second!

00:20:20.552 --> 00:20:23.789
If he keeps going, the general
public will sustain casualties!

00:20:23.789 --> 00:20:25.157
Hey, look at that.

00:20:25.157 --> 00:20:26.391
What is it?

00:20:26.391 --> 00:20:29.155
- Ls it an accident?
- Lt's on fire!

00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:34.559
What's that?!

00:20:44.476 --> 00:20:47.604
W-What is that?

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:53.916
Is that a Dragon?

00:21:01.293 --> 00:21:03.318
I won't let you touch Jin!

00:21:06.198 --> 00:21:07.825
Toa...

00:21:26.818 --> 00:21:30.789
Toa, just who are you?

00:21:30.789 --> 00:21:33.986
Please, close your eyes.

00:21:59.918 --> 00:22:01.053
Toa...

00:22:07.659 --> 00:22:14.333
Me to me ga atta shunkan

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:21.106
kanashimi ga hajimaru ki ga shita

00:22:21.106 --> 00:22:27.779
Keshite mo kienai kioku ima demo

00:22:27.779 --> 00:22:35.015
futari no kokoro tsunaide'ru

00:22:36.855 --> 00:22:43.695
Ikusen no hoshi no kazu hodo hito wa

00:22:43.695 --> 00:22:46.698
afurete iru no ni ne

00:22:46.698 --> 00:22:50.569
kimi shika mienai

00:22:50.569 --> 00:22:53.739
Aenakute mo

00:22:53.739 --> 00:22:56.642
kanawanakute mo

00:22:56.642 --> 00:23:02.948
tsunoru omoi wa kitto eien

00:23:02.948 --> 00:23:09.955
Unmei ga futari wo hikisaku nara

00:23:09.955 --> 00:23:16.795
deaeta koto dake wo kiseki to shinjite

00:23:16.795 --> 00:23:23.402
Hora nagarete'ku kono ame no you

00:23:23.402 --> 00:23:29.441
Itoshisa dake wo kimi ni furasetai

00:23:29.441 --> 00:23:33.639
Rain of Love

00:23:43.322 --> 00:23:47.259
Excellent work, everyone.
This is ISDA operator Saki.

00:23:47.259 --> 00:23:51.129
Today is a tremendously auspicious day...

00:23:51.129 --> 00:23:54.099
- What?
- Hey, this is two weeks
running now, Megumi-san.

00:23:54.099 --> 00:23:56.968
She just wants herself to
stand out, huh, Ryoko-san?

00:23:56.968 --> 00:23:58.937
You two are both here, too, right?

00:23:58.937 --> 00:24:00.605
Just being here isn't enough!

00:24:00.605 --> 00:24:02.207
We don't say a thing!

00:24:02.207 --> 00:24:04.810
There's still a long way
to go. Just bear with it.

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:06.712
The preview time is running out, again!

00:24:06.712 --> 00:24:08.942
Next time, there's a monster battle!
